INDEMNIFICATION, ESCROW AND HOLDBACK RELEASE DEED

M&A Transaction Holdback Facility | Escrow Account No. 8940-1920-410 | Governed by Delaware Law

This Escrow and Indemnification Release Agreement ('Release') is dated as of December 05, 2024, among BLUESTAR THERAPEUTICS INC. ('Buyer'), GENOMIC BIOLABS CORP. ('Seller Representative'), and JPMORGAN CHASE BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION, as Escrow Agent ('Escrow Agent').

WHEREAS, pursuant to the Agreement and Plan of Merger dated December 15, 2023, Buyer deposited an aggregate indemnity holdback amount of USD 15,000,000.00 ('Escrow Fund') into segregated escrow;

WHEREAS, Buyer submitted formal Notice of Indemnification Claim Ref. CL-2024-04 alleging breach of Section 3.14 (Tax Representations) in the liquidated amount of USD 2,450,120.00;

NOW THEREFORE, in compromise of said dispute, the parties hereby issue joint written instructions to Escrow Agent to release funds as follows:

1. DISBURSEMENT TO BUYER: Escrow Agent shall disburse the sum of USD 1,850,000.00 by Fedwire to Buyer's designated operating account, in full and final settlement of Claim CL-2024-04;

2. RELEASE TO SELLERS: Escrow Agent shall distribute the remaining balance of USD 13,150,000.00, together with accrued interest of USD 314,920.18, pro rata to the former equityholders listed on Exhibit A;

3. MUTUAL RELEASE: Buyer and Seller Representative unconditionally release and discharge each other and their respective affiliates from all further liability under Article VIII of the Merger Agreement.

